MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonIntro::
    .string "Wahahah! You found your way in!\p"
    .string "WATTSON, that's me. I wired this\n"
    .string "city, and then I wired this room\l"
    .string "to keep people out of it.\p"
    .string "KANTO's BADGES on you and not one\n"
    .string "of ours. Well, that's a thing we\l"
    .string "can fix.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonDefeat::
    .string "Wahahah! Beaten in my own circuit!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonBadge::
    .string "Take the DYNAMO BADGE, champion.\p"
    .string "{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM}{MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}The man at SLATEPORT's harbor will\n"
    .string "want to write that one down.\p"
    .string "And the barriers are off for good\n"
    .string "now. Walk out the short way.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_TakeThisTM::
    .string "Here, take this with you.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM34::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM34 from\n"
    .string "WATTSON!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM34::
    .string "TM34 is SHOCK WAVE.\p"
    .string "It never misses. No dodging, no\n"
    .string "luck, nothing to argue with.\p"
    .string "Electricity is honest that way.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_NoRoomForTM34::
    .string "Your BAG's full, and I'm not\n"
    .string "carrying it for you. Come back.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonPostBattle::
    .string "Wahahah! Still here, still wired.\p"
    .string "If you've a day to spare, NEW\n"
    .string "MAUVILLE under the city is losing\l"
    .string "power somewhere and I'm too old to\l"
    .string "go crawling after it.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue::
    .string "MAUVILLE CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: WATTSON\p"
    .string "“The current runs through him.”$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonErrand::
    .string "Now then. A favour, since you're\n"
    .string "standing there looking capable.\p"
    .string "NEW MAUVILLE runs under this city.\n"
    .string "I built it. I sealed it. And it is\l"
    .string "still drawing power it has no\l"
    .string "business drawing.\p"
    .string "Take the key. Find the generator\n"
    .string "and shut it down.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedBasementKey::
    .string "{PLAYER} received the BASEMENT\n"
    .string "KEY from WATTSON!$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonErrandWaiting::
    .string "The entrance is on ROUTE 110, in\n"
    .string "the bank below the cycling road.\p"
    .string "Mind the POKéMON down there. They\n"
    .string "have had the run of it since I\l"
    .string "locked the door.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_WattsonThanks::
    .string "Wahahah! The meters went quiet an\n"
    .string "hour ago and I knew it was you.\p"
    .string "That place can stay off now. Take\n"
    .string "this for the walk.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM24::
    .string "{PLAYER} received TM24 from\n"
    .string "WATTSON!$"
MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H0_0::
    .string "The barriers move when you stand\n"
    .string "on a switch. Mind where you stand.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H0_1::
    .string "Shocked, and not by the barriers.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H0_2::
    .string "Four switches, two patterns. It's\n"
    .string "simpler than it looks and harder\l"
    .string "than it sounds.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H1_0::
    .string "KANTO's LEADERS don't wire their\n"
    .string "gyms like this.\p"
    .string "WATTSON can't help himself.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H1_1::
    .string "Neither can you, apparently.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H1_2::
    .string "Every switch you press undoes\n"
    .string "another one. That's the whole\l"
    .string "room.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H2_0::
    .string "Electric types and a maze. He\n"
    .string "thinks it's funny.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H2_1::
    .string "He'll think that was funny too.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H2_2::
    .string "Ground types walk through this gym\n"
    .string "like it's a corridor. Don't tell\l"
    .string "him I said so.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H3_0::
    .string "I've worked here two years and\n"
    .string "I still take a wrong turn.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H3_1::
    .string "Straight line to me, though.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H3_2::
    .string "The BADGE is worth the walk. He\n"
    .string "doesn't hand it over politely.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H4::
    .string "New face! Let me save you some\n"
    .string "walking.\p"
    .string "WATTSON uses ELECTRIC types, so\n"
    .string "leave the water and the flying at\l"
    .string "the door.\p"
    .string "GROUND types don't care about him\n"
    .string "at all.\p"
    .string "And the barriers: step on a\n"
    .string "switch, the pattern changes. Keep\l"
    .string "track of which one you touched\l"
    .string "last.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H5_0::
    .string "Last one before the LEADER.\p"
    .string "He's heard you coming. He hears\n"
    .string "everything in here.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H5_1::
    .string "…Go on, then.$"

MauvilleCity_Gym_Text_H5_2::
    .string "Straight up the middle when the\n"
    .string "barriers are down. That's the way\l"
    .string "he likes to be met.$"
